# Mockingbird returned from the graveyard by Reanimate was not cast, so no mana was spent to cast it (CR 601.2h): it can copy only
# creatures with mana value 0 or less. Bot2's Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) came first on the battlefield and would be the
# default pick if it were allowed; only Ornithopter (mana value 0) is, so Mockingbird becomes a Bird Thopter Ornithopter 0/2
# with no question asked about which. Reanimate costs Bot1 1 life, the Mockingbird's mana value in the graveyard ({X}{U}, X is 0).

